; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Update-VCSG-Location-Request
; Section: 5A.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5A.2.1.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI, formatted according to TS 23.003 [3], clause 2.2."
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: uva-experimental-result-vendor
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: Update-VCSG-Location-Answer
; Section: 5A.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5A.2.1.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This is a grouped AVP which shall contain the 3GPP Vendor ID in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
