; AVP: MSISDN
; Command: Update-VCSG-Location-Request
; Section: 5A.2.1.1.1
; Table: 5A.2.1.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This information element shall contain the user MSISDN, formatted according to TS 29.329 [25]. It shall be present if available."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: cvr-user-name-imsi
; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Cancel-VCSG-Location-Request
; Section: 5A.2.1.2.1
; Table: 5A.2.1.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI, formatted according to TS 23.003 [3], clause 2.2."
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: s7a-idr-user-name-imsi
; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Insert-Subscriber-Data-Request
; Application-ID: 16777308
; Section: 5A.2.2.1.1
; Table: 5A.2.2.1.1/1
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI, formatted according to TS 23.003 [3], clause 2.2."
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: s7a-ida-experimental-result-vendor
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: Insert-Subscriber-Data-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777308
; Section: 5A.2.2.1.1
; Table: 5A.2.2.1.1/2
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This is a grouped AVP which shall contain the 3GPP Vendor Id in the Vendor-Id AVP, and the error code in the Experimental-Result-Code AVP."
    requires Experimental-Result/Vendor-Id = 10415


;; The S7a/S7d IDR carries no CSG-Subscription-Data: its body and table
;; 5A.2.2.1.1/1 hold VPLMN-CSG-Subscription-Data, at least one, so as
;; printed the condition never holds; and the error the clause names is no
;; result code this document defines (TS 29.329's 5106 is Sh's).
; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: s7a-ida-subs-data-absent
; AVP: Experimental-Result
; Command: Insert-Subscriber-Data-Answer
; Application-ID: 16777308
; Section: 5A.2.2.1.2
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"If the request does not contain any CSG-Subscription-Data AVP, Experimental-Result shall be set to DIAMETER_ERROR_SUBS_DATA_ABSENT."
    text-only


; Type: Interpreted Constraints
; Id: s7a-dsr-user-name-imsi
; AVP: User-Name
; Command: Delete-Subscriber-Data-Request
; Application-ID: 16777308
; Section: 5A.2.2.2.1
; Table: 5A.2.2.2.1/1
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"This information element shall contain the user IMSI, formatted according to TS 23.003 [3], clause 2.2."
    encoding digits
    length 6..15 digits


