; Id: clr-auth-session-state
; AVP: Auth-Session-State
; Command: Cancel-Location-Request
; Section: 7.1.4
; Versions: 18.7.0..19.6.0
"The client (server) shall include in its requests (responses) the Auth-Session-State AVP set to the value NO_STATE_MAINTAINED (1), as described in IETF RFC 6733 [61]."
    range 1


